From 1668ddcc82d6fd33f0e1f489137a7a90167f16c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guilherme Silva <239806034+NoneSilva@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:48:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Bind the MCP server to loopback

The server is started with app.listen(port) and no host, so Node binds the
unspecified address and answers on every interface, and POST /mcp has no
authentication. Bind the listener to 127.0.0.1, advertise that address in the
log line and in the Cursor and VS Code registrations, and assert the bind
address in the MCP test suite.

Signed-off-by: Guilherme Silva <239806034+NoneSilva@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 src/lm/MCPServer.ts              | 12 +++++------
 tests/suite/lm/mcpServer.test.ts | 35 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

